---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title={`About ${AUTHOR_NAME}`}
	description="Learn about the author, engineering background, and vision behind this tech & AI blog."
	pubDate={new Date('September 12 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Welcome! I'm <strong>{AUTHOR_NAME}</strong>, a software engineer and builder passionate about 
		artificial intelligence, autonomous agents, web architecture, and developer productivity.
	</p>

	<h2>What This Blog Is About</h2>
	<p>
		This space is dedicated to practical, deep-dive articles on modern technology, AI agent safety and coordination, hardware & network auditing, and automation. Every post aims to deliver actionable technical insights, code patterns, and real-world experiments.
	</p>

	<h2>Building & Automation Stack</h2>
	<p>
		This blog is engineered as a static site using <strong>Astro</strong>, version-controlled on <strong>GitHub</strong>, and deployed through automated CI/CD pipelines. The goal is a fast, lightweight, and resilient platform optimized for reading speed and search engine visibility.
	</p>

	<h2>Get in Touch</h2>
	<p>
		Have questions, topic suggestions, or feedback? Feel free to connect or follow along on social platforms via the links in the footer below.
	</p>
</Layout>
